Build the thesis from this directory:

    latexmk -pdf -synctex=1 -interaction=nonstopmode -file-line-error 00thesis.tex

The root document is 00thesis.tex. In VS Code / LaTeX Workshop, open that
file and run Build LaTeX project. Latexmk runs BibTeX and repeats pdfLaTeX
as needed to resolve citations, tables of contents, and cross-references.

For a minimal TinyTeX installation, install the additional packages with:

    tlmgr install algorithms comment sectsty datatool tracklang tocloft apacite pdfpages ragged2e listings fancyhdr caption multirow courier

The algorithms package provides both algorithm.sty and algorithmic.sty.
Package dependencies are installed automatically by tlmgr.

If an interrupted build leaves stale auxiliary files, clean them and rebuild:

    latexmk -c 00thesis.tex
    latexmk -pdf -synctex=1 -interaction=nonstopmode -file-line-error 00thesis.tex

Manual build (without latexmk):

    pdflatex 00thesis.tex
    bibtex 00thesis
    pdflatex 00thesis.tex
    pdflatex 00thesis.tex
